            <ArticleTitle>Combined fluphenazine and lidocaine for pain relief in head and neck cancers.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>69-70</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A successful method of treating intractable neoplastic pain in 12 cases is discussed. A completely new method was tried combining long-acting phenothiazine and lidocaine to achieve long-lasting pain relief. This combination gave pain relief which lasted for weeks. A possible explanation of the mechanism is offered.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
